  "details": "1. Open VRChat\n\n2. After finishing downloading the world, press on \"GO\"\n\n3. During the loading screen when the screen is still black, turn off the wifi, then turn it on again, this will generate a network error, forcing the player to rejoin the instancd.\n\n4. Notice how the world is shown in the background of the loading screen with a pink shader glitch.\n\nWhen that issue happened, I didn't noticed anything game breaking.",
